+  /* Opcodes which have a varying number of parameters in the data stream  */
+  /* (NPUSHB, NPUSHW) are handled specially; they have a negative value in */
+  /* the `opcode_length' table, and the value in `Pop_Push_Count' is set   */
+  /* to zero.                                                              */
